    apply: "Choose one habit of faith you want your children to see in you, such as daily prayer or thankfulness, and practise it openly this week. If you have been inconsistent, apologise to your child and ask God to help you. Read Psalm 78:1-8 and note what the writer wants passed on.",
    activity: "Ask learners to list habits they would like to see in their children and then ask whether they model them. Role-play a parent apologising to a child for a failure. Read Deuteronomy 6:4-9 and discuss the order of instruction. Pray for sincere faith.",
