    sa: ["How can parents teach the faith in ordinary moments?", ["daily", "stories", "questions", "prayer", "verse", "talk"], "A good answer says parents weave faith into mealtimes, journeys, bedtime and mornings with stories, songs, Scripture, prayer and honest answers to questions."],
