    summary: "This session reviews lessons 1 to 12: children as a gift and trust, knowing each child, parents as models, teaching in ordinary moments, family worship, telling the gospel, love and affection, fatherhood, motherhood and teamwork, the purpose of discipline, discipline without cruelty, and boundaries and consistency. It prepares learners for the mid-session test.",
    scripture: ["Psalm 127:3", "Deuteronomy 6:6-7"], more: ["Ephesians 6:4", "Hebrews 12:11", "Proverbs 15:1"], memory: "Deuteronomy 6:6-7",
