    sa: ["Summarise in two or three sentences what the Bible teaches about raising children so far.", ["gift", "teach", "example", "love", "discipline", "god"], "A good answer says children are a gift and trust from God, parents teach by example and in daily life, love is the foundation, and discipline is loving, calm and consistent training, never cruelty."],
